WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.312
Sustainable AI governance combines inventory, ownership, risk classification, policies, evaluation, monitoring, human oversight, incident response, and continuous improvement.

2
00:00:12.312 --> 00:00:14.727
Governance should not be a one-time checklist.

3
00:00:14.727 --> 00:00:22.809
As AI systems, laws, standards, vendors, and organizational needs evolve, governance practices must evolve as well.

4
00:00:22.809 --> 00:00:25.972
The best governance programs are practical enough to use.

5
00:00:25.972 --> 00:00:32.817
They help teams make decisions, document important context, respond to issues, and improve the system over time.

6
00:00:32.817 --> 00:00:40.809
The goal is responsible innovation: enabling useful AI while managing risk with discipline, transparency, and accountability.
